---
import DesignLayout from '../layouts/DesignLayout.astro';
---
<DesignLayout section="Operating System" title="Launch System" focus="What has to be true before GreenSquare turns the system outward?">
  <section class="ops-section ops-intro"><p class="ops-kicker">Execution layer</p><h2>Launch only when doctrine, production and conversion are connected.</h2><p>The Launch System is the final downstream layer. It ensures GreenSquare does not publish disconnected assets. The Judgment OS governs reasoning, the Knowledge Base governs source truth, the Social System governs public expression, and the Content Engine governs production. Launch connects them to a conversion path and a measurable operating cadence.</p></section>
  <section class="ops-section"><div class="ops-heading"><span>01</span><h2>Dependency chain</h2></div><ol class="ops-flow">{['Judgment OS','Knowledge Base','Social System','Content Engine','Launch'].map((x,i)=><li><span>{String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span><strong>{x}</strong><small>{i===0?'Decision doctrine':i===1?'Canonical source truth':i===2?'Publishing doctrine':i===3?'Repeatable production':'Distribution, conversion and learning'}</small></li>)}</ol></section>
  <section class="ops-section"><div class="ops-heading"><span>02</span><h2>Launch readiness</h2></div><div class="ops-grid">{[['Conversion path','The free Decision Frame is the default launch CTA and the path from content to capture is working.'],['Content inventory','The first two weeks are produced before launch, not created day by day.'],['Channel adaptation','Each idea is adapted to its channel role rather than cross-posted mechanically.'],['Evidence QA','Claims, numbers and benchmark references are source-backed and current.'],['Visual QA','Assets conform to the canonical design language and remain recognisable as GreenSquare.'],['Measurement','Acquisition, saves, shares, downloads and conversion are measurable.'],['Operating cadence','Publishing and review can continue without requiring daily founder attention.'],['Learning loop','Performance notes feed future hooks, examples and formats without changing doctrine.']].map(([t,b])=><article class="ops-card"><h3>{t}</h3><p>{b}</p></article>)}</div></section>
  <section class="ops-section"><div class="ops-heading"><span>03</span><h2>First campaign</h2></div><div class="ops-campaign"><p class="ops-number">30</p><div><h3>Days of better decisions</h3><p>Start with Decision Frame extracts. Move through framing, option generation, critical assumptions, evidence discipline and action. The campaign should make the method useful before asking the audience to download it.</p><strong>Primary CTA: Get the free Decision Frame.</strong></div></div></section>
  <section class="ops-section ops-dark"><p class="ops-kicker">Operating principle</p><h2>Do the production work in batches. Keep daily effort for response, learning and judgement, not manufacturing posts from scratch.</h2></section>
</DesignLayout>
<style>.ops-section{padding:clamp(3rem,6vw,6rem);border-top:1px solid var(--design-line)}.ops-intro{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.65fr 1fr;gap:3rem}.ops-intro h2,.ops-dark h2{font-size:clamp(2.2rem,4vw,4rem);line-height:1.03;margin:0;letter-spacing:-.03em}.ops-intro p:last-child{font-size:1.15rem;line-height:1.65}.ops-kicker,.ops-heading span,.ops-flow span{font-size:.75rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--design-muted)}.ops-heading{display:grid;grid-template-columns:4rem 1fr;margin-bottom:2.5rem}.ops-heading h2{margin:0;font-size:2.2rem}.ops-flow{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;border-top:1px solid var(--design-line)}.ops-flow li{display:grid;grid-template-columns:4rem 1fr 1fr;gap:1rem;padding:1.2rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--design-line)}.ops-flow small{color:var(--design-muted)}.ops-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);border-top:1px solid var(--design-line);border-left:1px solid var(--design-line)}.ops-card{padding:1.5rem;border-right:1px solid var(--design-line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--design-line);min-height:11rem}.ops-card h3{margin:0 0 2rem;font-size:1.25rem}.ops-card p{color:var(--design-muted);line-height:1.55}.ops-campaign{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.7fr 1.3fr;gap:4rem;align-items:end}.ops-number{font-family:"Space Grotesk",sans-serif;font-size:clamp(8rem,20vw,18rem);line-height:.75;letter-spacing:-.08em;margin:0;color:var(--design-forest)}.ops-campaign h3{font-size:2.4rem;margin:0 0 1rem}.ops-campaign p:not(.ops-number){font-size:1.15rem;line-height:1.65;color:var(--design-muted)}.ops-dark{background:var(--design-rail);color:white}.ops-dark .ops-kicker{color:rgba(255,255,255,.55)}@media(max-width:850px){.ops-intro,.ops-grid,.ops-campaign,.ops-flow li{grid-template-columns:1fr}.ops-flow li{gap:.4rem}}</style>